  <para unique="1046232">
   <string>A numerically exact implementation of VRCP14xx can be found at:</string></para>
  <para unique="1046234">
   <anchor id="message URL https://software.intel.com/en-us/articles/reference-implementations-for-IA-approximation-instructions-vrcp14-vrsqrt14-vrcp28-vrsqrt28-vexp2"/><underline><string>https://software.intel.com/en-us/articles/reference-implementations-for-IA-approximation-instructions-vrcp14-vrsqrt14-vrcp28-vrsqrt28-vexp2</string></underline><string>.</string></para>
  </longdesc>
 <subsection title="Intel C/C++ Compiler Intrinsic Equivalent">
  <para unique="1046255">
   <string>VRCP14PS __m512 _mm512_rcp14_ps( __m512 a);</string></para>
  <para unique="1046256">
   <string>VRCP14PS __m512 _mm512_mask_rcp14_ps(__m512 s, __mmask16 k, __m512 a);</string></para>
  <para unique="1046257">
   <string>VRCP14PS __m512 _mm512_maskz_rcp14_ps( __mmask16 k, __m512 a);</string></para>
  <para unique="1046258">
   <string>VRCP14PS __m256 _mm256_rcp14_ps( __m256 a);</string></para>
  <para unique="1046259">
   <string>VRCP14PS __m256 _mm512_mask_rcp14_ps(__m256 s, __mmask8 k, __m256 a);</string></para>
  <para unique="1046260">
   <string>VRCP14PS __m256 _mm512_maskz_rcp14_ps( __mmask8 k, __m256 a);</string></para>
  <para unique="1046261">
   <string>VRCP14PS __m128 _mm_rcp14_ps( __m128 a);</string></para>
  <para unique="1046262">
   <string>VRCP14PS __m128 _mm_mask_rcp14_ps(__m128 s, __mmask8 k, __m128 a);</string></para>
  <para unique="1046263">
   <string>VRCP14PS __m128 _mm_maskz_rcp14_ps( __mmask8 k, __m128 a);</string></para>
  </subsection>
 <subsection title="SIMD Floating-Point Exceptions">
  <para unique="1046265">
   <string>None.</string></para>
  </subsection>
 <subsection title="Other Exceptions">
  <para unique="1046270" format="xIndent1">
   <string>See </string><link linkend="79250: 06_Table: Table 2-49. Type E4 Class Exception Conditions"><string>Table&#160;2&#8209;51, &#8220;Type E4 Class Exception Conditions.&#8221;</string></link></para>
  </subsection>
 </instruction>
